  "notes": "No implementation and no observed evidence of ONE exist at this snapshot. v0.3.0 closes the pre-code state: ADR-007 accepts the O1 implementation foundation from the Q1 research (research remains research; disposition in research/q1-disposition.md), ADR-008 pins the O1 oracles, and SPEC-003 v0.2 resolves misaligned RV64IM accesses and reserved *IW encodings using reproducible oracle probes (research/o1-oracle-probes.md), which characterize external tools and are not ledger evidence. Decisions are architectural, not performance claims. Pre-held-out items (K contracts, corpus, held-out, controls, U1-U7, Q9, Q10, Q25, preregistration) remain open. v0.2.0 consolidated the foundation into accepted decisions (ADR-004..006), designed semantic contracts, the O1 falsification protocol, metrics, a claims registry and an empty evidence ledger. research/hypotheses.md was replaced by claims.md. Private project context is intentionally excluded from the public manifest and git tracking."
